      "description": "A chamber-room (3.9 m × 3.8 m × 2.5 m) furnished as an office, with neutral room-coloration (off-white walls/ceiling, off-white with grey trailing patterns on floor). Included a big green flower, two false windows with green curtains, green writing pads, and a PC. Physical variables (heat, humidity) controlled by a computerized climate system.",
