  "mechanisms": [
    "Luminous milieu acts as a mood inducer, inducing different mood valences in subjects.",
    "Mood valences, in turn, affect cognitive processes.",
    "Mood-congruence phenomenon: subjects recall more words from a positive than a negative word-list, consistent with their induced mood.",
    "Halo effect: a rater bias leading to an overall impression of an appraisee derived from a salient characteristic (e.g., gender), influencing performance appraisal scores."
  ],
